WEBVTT

01:24.800 --> 01:28.320
ADAPTED FROM ZHUANG ZHUANG'S
ORIGINAL NOVEL "BROCADE ODYSSEY"

01:36.880 --> 01:40.400
This is called not learning your lesson
until it is too late.

01:51.880 --> 01:53.120
General, do not forget.

01:53.640 --> 01:55.480
The military commissioner
just issued an order.

01:55.560 --> 01:58.360
Ms. Ji must dye Shu Red Silk
and weave tribute brocade.

01:58.440 --> 02:00.640
To possess such a skill
is to invite misfortune.

02:02.480 --> 02:06.320
Ms. Ji's impressive talent
will attract envy.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.560
Her family could be wiped out.

02:09.199 --> 02:10.919
As much as I pity that,

02:11.000 --> 02:12.640
there is nothing I can do to help.

02:14.440 --> 02:15.720
Mr. Yang,

02:16.520 --> 02:18.800
I have no interest
in listening to nonsense.

02:18.880 --> 02:23.720
So, think carefully before answering me.

02:31.000 --> 02:32.400
I came to Yizhou

02:32.920 --> 02:34.920
not to target you, General,

02:35.840 --> 02:37.800
but to restore order
in the brocade industry.

02:39.840 --> 02:43.000
I will investigate
whoever stands in my way.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.320
Behind me stands

02:48.760 --> 02:51.720
all the imperial officers
who still have a shred of conscience.

03:09.320 --> 03:10.320
Yingying?

03:13.200 --> 03:14.280
Yingying!

03:20.120 --> 03:21.360
Yaoting?

03:27.600 --> 03:28.600
Yaoting!

03:34.440 --> 03:35.640
General!

03:35.720 --> 03:38.120
You scoundrel!
Who gave the order to use force?

03:38.200 --> 03:40.560
Are you trying to draw even more attention
from the military commissioner?

03:40.640 --> 03:41.720
He is not one of us.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.280
What?

03:44.560 --> 03:45.760
It is me.

03:46.640 --> 03:49.800
- Master Gao?
- I came on Mr. Yang's orders.

03:50.480 --> 03:52.320
Please cooperate with me, Ms. Ji.

03:52.400 --> 03:54.880
Just act your part.
I will follow your lead.

03:56.880 --> 03:59.040
Chief Sang's men have arrived!
I must leave now.

03:59.120 --> 04:01.040
- Wait!
- Ms. Ji, you!

04:04.160 --> 04:06.720
Since this is all an act,
let's make it convincing.

04:08.880 --> 04:10.040
Do not even think about hurting my sister!

04:10.120 --> 04:11.400
Yaoting!

04:11.480 --> 04:12.920
To those inside, listen!

04:13.000 --> 04:14.600
Chief Sang is here!

04:16.560 --> 04:18.240
- Yingying?
- Yingying!

04:18.320 --> 04:19.279
Yingying?

04:19.360 --> 04:20.720
- Yaoting.
- What happened?

04:21.480 --> 04:22.600
How did you get hurt?

04:23.120 --> 04:26.080
- Ms. Ji, this…
- Gui, quickly fetch a doctor!

04:26.160 --> 04:27.640
- Hurry up!
- No need. No need!

04:27.720 --> 04:29.480
Gui, Mother, I am fine.

04:29.560 --> 04:30.880
But you are bleeding!

04:30.960 --> 04:32.400
How can you say you are fine?

04:36.560 --> 04:37.600
You…

04:38.200 --> 04:39.600
It is just a small cut.

04:39.680 --> 04:42.760
Find a reliable physician, but tell them
to make it sound worse than it is.

04:44.320 --> 04:45.560
Open the door immediately!

05:00.120 --> 05:01.280
Chief Sang.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.840
Where is the assassin?

05:04.920 --> 05:06.000
He is gone.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.440
- Search the area!
- Yes, sir!

05:18.040 --> 05:19.120
Report!

05:20.920 --> 05:23.280
Chief Sang, we found this token.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.720
NIU

05:31.480 --> 05:34.920
You punk! Do not harm me!

05:35.840 --> 05:37.680
I would not dream of it.

05:37.760 --> 05:39.360
This could be a great merit.

05:42.160 --> 05:43.400
This…

05:51.840 --> 05:53.640
General Niu, Governor Zhang,

05:54.360 --> 05:57.280
it is my fault for troubling both of you.

05:58.520 --> 06:00.760
You are here as well, Mr. Yang.
What a coincidence.

06:02.320 --> 06:03.600
Not quite.

06:04.320 --> 06:06.040
But the Ji family
is no ordinary household.

06:06.120 --> 06:10.440
Ms. Ji shoulders the irreplaceable task
of weaving the tribute brocade.

06:10.520 --> 06:13.760
As the brocade officer,
it is my duty to give them more attention.

06:13.840 --> 06:17.600
It is just an ordinary silk merchant
attacked by robbers.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.880
Surely that does not warrant
troubling Governor Zhang.

06:19.960 --> 06:22.000
Normally, no.

06:22.080 --> 06:24.680
And certainly not enough
to disturb you, General.

06:25.560 --> 06:29.520
But during Chief Sang's search,
the thief left behind something curious.

06:30.120 --> 06:32.720
Perhaps,
you would like to take a look, General?

06:53.600 --> 06:54.720
NIU

06:56.920 --> 06:58.600
My token?

07:00.040 --> 07:04.360
This thief is truly despicable
to dare steal my token!

07:04.880 --> 07:07.000
Very well. So, Chief Sang,

07:08.120 --> 07:12.640
are you implying
that I intended to kill Ms. Ji?

07:13.240 --> 07:14.520
I would not dare.

07:15.400 --> 07:17.440
But the token…

07:17.520 --> 07:20.400
The token was clearly planted by someone
seeking to frame you, General Niu.

07:23.960 --> 07:26.800
General Niu and I were in the tavern
the entire time,

07:27.320 --> 07:31.640
I can vouch it is certainly
not the work of General Niu.

07:32.760 --> 07:35.960
Moreover, if he truly intended harm,
he would not risk exposure,

07:36.040 --> 07:40.160
nor would he carry anything
that could reveal his identity.

07:41.200 --> 07:43.520
Therefore, I believe

07:43.600 --> 07:46.320
that this must be a deliberate attempt
to slander the General.

07:49.880 --> 07:54.560
In that case, why trouble the General
with this matter, Mr. Yang?

07:55.800 --> 07:57.040
May I say something, Governor Zhang?

07:58.160 --> 08:01.000
Mr. Yang's intentions are only
to protect the General's reputation.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.080
Surely, you know

08:03.160 --> 08:06.480
that the General's beloved daughter
is marrying my former betrothed.

08:07.120 --> 08:09.120
Additionally,
I have successfully dyed Shu Red Silk.

08:09.200 --> 08:10.800
It is a feat

08:10.880 --> 08:13.800
that has forced the General's son-in-law
to show Zhao Red Silk.

08:14.760 --> 08:16.120
To the public,

08:16.200 --> 08:18.520
it would seem perfectly reasonable
for you to harbor a grudge against me

08:18.600 --> 08:20.600
and wish me harm, General.

08:21.400 --> 08:23.240
This situation has provided
the perfect opportunity

08:23.320 --> 08:24.800
for someone to exploit it
and stir trouble.

08:25.960 --> 08:29.840
If we ignore this now and take no action,

08:29.920 --> 08:32.559
I fear it may escalate

08:33.080 --> 08:35.720
and bring harm
to the General rather than benefits.

08:38.159 --> 08:40.840
Ms. Ji, your reasoning is sound.

08:41.679 --> 08:45.680
But my conduct is upright
and beyond reproach.

08:46.480 --> 08:47.360
I am not afraid of rumors.

08:48.480 --> 08:51.200
If she were an ordinary woman,
it would not matter.

08:51.280 --> 08:53.400
But now, the tribute brocade
depends on her.

08:54.000 --> 08:55.320
If something were to happen to her,

08:55.400 --> 08:56.480
the tribute brocade
would not be completed.

08:56.560 --> 08:58.600
It might implicate a general as well.

08:59.440 --> 09:02.600
The imperial court
would send investigators.

09:02.680 --> 09:05.400
General, your conduct is indeed upright
and beyond reproach.

09:05.920 --> 09:10.240
But how many others in Yizhou
can withstand such scrutiny?

09:21.080 --> 09:24.040
What is your brilliant solution
to this, Mr. Yang?

09:26.680 --> 09:27.720
Governor Zhang,

09:28.520 --> 09:30.680
since someone dared to impersonate
General Niu

09:30.760 --> 09:32.480
to assassinate Ms. Ji,

09:32.560 --> 09:35.240
why not turn the tables?

09:35.880 --> 09:38.440
Let General Niu personally protect Ms. Ji.

09:38.520 --> 09:41.760
First, the General's wisdom and valor
are unmatched, ensuring her safety.

09:41.840 --> 09:44.200
Second,
as long as Ms. Ji remains unharmed,

09:44.720 --> 09:47.320
the rumors
will naturally fade away on their own.

09:49.400 --> 09:55.040
What does Ms. Ji's safety
have to do with me?

09:55.680 --> 09:59.520
Besides, the city's defense
fall under Governor Zhang's jurisdiction.

10:00.760 --> 10:01.600
That is true.

10:02.280 --> 10:03.640
In that case, Ms. Ji,

10:03.720 --> 10:06.520
I will need you to follow me
to the military camp.

10:06.600 --> 10:09.520
We will present this wound and token

10:10.320 --> 10:13.760
to the military commissioner and have him
properly investigate the matter,

10:13.840 --> 10:15.600
clearing your name.

10:15.680 --> 10:16.560
Very well.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.920
If I have the opportunity
to meet the military commissioner,

10:19.000 --> 10:23.080
I will gladly tell him everything I know.

10:25.280 --> 10:28.480
Why are we dragging
the military commissioner into this?

10:28.560 --> 10:29.880
How tiresome.

10:30.400 --> 10:31.240
Fine.

10:31.760 --> 10:34.920
Mr. Yang, Ms. Ji, you can trust me.

10:35.920 --> 10:38.640
Though my duty is to guard the frontier,

10:39.160 --> 10:41.640
I may not be able to deploy troops
to protect you.

10:41.720 --> 10:45.160
But I will not allow Ms. Ji
to fall victim to these vile schemes.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.360
How about that?

10:46.880 --> 10:48.760
Hurry up, and thank General Niu.

10:53.200 --> 10:54.480
Thank you, General Niu!

10:54.560 --> 10:57.240
No need. It is a minor matter.

11:01.960 --> 11:02.960
Thank you.

11:33.680 --> 11:34.800
Ms. Niu,

11:35.440 --> 11:36.520
are you all right?

11:37.440 --> 11:38.560
It is nothing.

11:38.640 --> 11:40.880
After so many years,
I have grown used to it.

11:43.440 --> 11:45.880
If I had not been held captive
in the mountains,

11:45.960 --> 11:47.480
you would not have gone there either.

11:50.520 --> 11:52.560
The matters of the brocade workshop
could not be hidden forever.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.040
Even without you,

11:55.120 --> 11:58.040
Yang Jinglan would have found another way
to lure me to the mountains.

11:59.400 --> 12:00.480
You should not blame yourself.

12:01.080 --> 12:06.760
But Ms. Niu, you have suffered so much
and endured so much hardships.

12:06.840 --> 12:08.840
It was so difficult
to get to where you are today.

12:10.520 --> 12:11.920
How could I not blame myself?

12:17.880 --> 12:19.360
But if it were not for you,

12:20.440 --> 12:22.600
who would have supported me to this day?

12:26.800 --> 12:28.480
I made a promise

12:29.360 --> 12:31.040
on the day you saved me.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.960
I am not a maid of the Niu household,

12:34.920 --> 12:36.600
but I am

12:37.720 --> 12:39.040
your maid, Ms. Niu.

12:47.080 --> 12:48.360
I do not believe in fate.

12:51.800 --> 12:54.280
I refuse to be a man's accessory.

12:56.040 --> 12:57.720
I will live my own life.

12:59.240 --> 13:00.240
Ms. Niu,

13:01.680 --> 13:03.120
I will stand by your side.

13:11.120 --> 13:12.200
Why are you here?

13:12.280 --> 13:13.760
You promised me.

13:14.360 --> 13:16.720
As long as I stayed away from her,
you would keep her safe.

13:16.800 --> 13:18.760
But today,
she almost died in the mountains!

13:18.840 --> 13:20.240
Did she die?

13:21.240 --> 13:22.560
Not only is she alive,

13:22.640 --> 13:25.200
but she has also received support
from the military commissioner.

13:26.320 --> 13:29.600
Now, the two of you will work together
to weave the tribute brocade.

13:30.720 --> 13:33.840
Looking at it this way,
should you not be thanking me?

13:33.920 --> 13:35.880
Going back on your word

13:35.960 --> 13:37.560
and twisting facts.

13:38.080 --> 13:39.880
Conducting business this way
will get you nowhere.

13:41.240 --> 13:43.000
My dear, have you forgotten?

13:43.640 --> 13:47.000
The decisions on whether this deal is made

13:49.080 --> 13:51.880
and how this deal is made
have always been mine to take.

13:55.920 --> 13:57.040
You have been crying.

14:01.000 --> 14:02.600
The wind in the mountains is harsh.

14:02.680 --> 14:03.840
Dust in my eyes, that is all.

14:06.520 --> 14:10.200
Is it dust in your eyes
or the sting of complete defeat?

14:19.840 --> 14:20.960
My dear,

14:21.720 --> 14:24.720
if I lose, I can simply start over.

14:25.680 --> 14:26.520
But you?

14:27.360 --> 14:30.800
You hold no pieces.
You cannot even make it to the chessboard.

14:32.040 --> 14:34.960
In the end, I will always be
the one moving the pieces.

14:35.480 --> 14:36.320
Is that not right?

14:41.920 --> 14:45.280
Mr. Yang, you found an excuse
to keep my brother and mother away.

14:45.360 --> 14:47.160
Is there something you want to tell me?

14:53.880 --> 14:55.320
Did I guess wrong?

14:55.840 --> 14:57.480
You had Gao Fang impersonate an assassin
from the Niu family.

14:58.280 --> 14:59.920
Isn't that to strike first

15:00.000 --> 15:02.000
and make Niu Jin hesitate
to harm me again?

15:02.080 --> 15:03.640
You guessed it right.

15:04.560 --> 15:06.080
But in my plan,

15:06.160 --> 15:08.280
there was no part
where you risked your life

15:08.360 --> 15:09.760
and got yourself stabbed, Ms. Ji.

15:11.800 --> 15:13.800
I was just worried
they would turn the tables

15:13.880 --> 15:15.280
and accuse us
of being the ones crying thief.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.800
I wanted to make the act more convincing.

15:17.760 --> 15:19.760
The physician did say I am fine.

15:22.320 --> 15:25.760
I told you I would protect you.
You promised to trust me.

15:27.400 --> 15:30.320
I did trust you.
That is why I played along.

15:35.000 --> 15:36.160
Guo Kui, go back!

15:36.240 --> 15:37.960
Why do you come out again?

15:45.200 --> 15:47.080
Next time, I will be more careful.

15:47.160 --> 15:50.320
Besides, I have you to back me up.

15:54.760 --> 15:58.800
Niu Jin would not dare
harm you directly for now.

15:59.560 --> 16:00.640
I fear

16:00.720 --> 16:04.160
the day the tribute brocade is completed
might be the day danger resurfaces.

16:05.040 --> 16:07.080
I am not afraid.
You will protect me, Mr. Yang.

16:08.800 --> 16:10.240
Bold words.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.440
Even Guo Kui cannot just wander
in wherever he likes.

16:21.200 --> 16:24.320
Niu Jin's hesitation today
was purely circumstantial.

16:26.240 --> 16:29.120
So, the more valuable the stakes,
the less likely he is to act rashly?

16:31.800 --> 16:35.040
- What are you planning now?
- I only know business.

16:36.520 --> 16:38.520
If I can dye Shu Red Silk

16:38.600 --> 16:41.640
and weave the most unique brocade
in the world,

16:41.720 --> 16:44.200
I can become Brocade Master,
a royal merchant,

16:44.280 --> 16:47.160
be the golden goose
that no one would dare to touch.

16:47.680 --> 16:51.840
If Niu Jin ever plans to harm me again,
he will have to think twice.

16:59.240 --> 17:00.240
Wait a moment.

17:23.760 --> 17:25.040
These are the records
of everyone in my family

17:25.119 --> 17:28.160
who could enter the brocade workshop
and dyehouse back then,

17:29.800 --> 17:32.040
as well as the workers involved
in transporting the tribute brocade

17:32.120 --> 17:33.400
and liaising with Brocade Bureau.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.040
I also have

17:35.120 --> 17:38.320
the names of the former brocade officer,
Liu Chongshan, and his guards.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.640
But I do not know

17:42.720 --> 17:44.480
the names of the logistics officer
who killed my father

17:44.560 --> 17:46.360
and the soldiers involved
in the handovers.

17:47.800 --> 17:50.760
If your master
truly investigated my father's case,

17:51.520 --> 17:55.840
perhaps these could help you
find the clues you are looking for.

17:59.840 --> 18:00.960
Yang Jinglan,

18:02.120 --> 18:05.000
I am entrusting my father's case to you.

18:10.320 --> 18:11.360
That's mine!

18:11.440 --> 18:13.560
- My father left it to me!
- After all these years,

18:14.320 --> 18:16.800
you still remember all these names?

18:17.840 --> 18:19.080
Give it back to me.

18:19.160 --> 18:20.000
Some things…

18:20.800 --> 18:23.320
Ji Guinan,
passing off inferior goods as tribute,

18:23.920 --> 18:25.600
deceiving the emperor,

18:25.680 --> 18:26.920
and resisting arrest…

18:27.000 --> 18:28.960
It cannot be forgotten,
no matter how long it has been.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.800
He will be executed immediately.

18:30.880 --> 18:34.240
Confiscate all the assets
of the Ji family.

18:34.320 --> 18:36.600
- Search the premises!
- Yes, sir!

18:49.000 --> 18:49.920
Mrs. Ji,

18:52.960 --> 18:54.640
Zhao Xiuyuan is waiting at the entrance.

18:55.240 --> 18:58.080
He says he wishes to discuss the weaving
of the tribute brocade with Ms. Ji.

19:01.360 --> 19:02.680
Go back!

19:04.560 --> 19:05.720
Sit down.

19:12.520 --> 19:14.120
Though we have past grievances,

19:14.200 --> 19:15.840
this is official business
and cannot be delayed.

19:16.920 --> 19:19.960
Mr. Yang, my daughter is gravely injured.

19:20.040 --> 19:22.480
Is it truly necessary to rush
the tribute brocade in these two days?

19:23.160 --> 19:24.920
No, it is not urgent.

19:25.960 --> 19:26.960
Not only is there no rush,

19:27.040 --> 19:28.560
there is also no need for Ms. Ji
to be involved in this matter at all.

19:29.080 --> 19:32.440
For the weaving of tribute brocade,
Ms. Ji only needs to dye Shu Red Silk

19:32.520 --> 19:34.440
according to the quantities
provided by Master Zhao.

19:34.520 --> 19:35.960
Once completed, the silk will be delivered
to Brocade Bureau

19:36.040 --> 19:38.640
for verification
and then handed over to Master Zhao.

19:40.640 --> 19:43.240
Ms. Ji, you are to stay here and recover.

19:43.320 --> 19:45.640
You cannot go anywhere.
I will go explain it to him myself.

19:51.040 --> 19:52.000
Mr. Yang,

19:55.480 --> 19:56.960
do not forget what I entrusted you with.

19:59.760 --> 20:00.680
Do not worry.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.320
Mother,

20:10.240 --> 20:11.480
I…

20:13.440 --> 20:16.400
Focus on getting better.
The rest can wait for another day.

20:18.000 --> 20:19.240
I will inform Bloom Society

20:19.320 --> 20:21.640
that you have caught a cold
and are resting at home.

20:21.720 --> 20:24.160
They can focus on dyeing silk
without worrying.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.560
Come now, rest.

20:28.080 --> 20:29.080
Get some rest.

20:31.920 --> 20:37.520
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

20:46.760 --> 20:49.200
You could have protected her
in other ways.

20:49.720 --> 20:50.800
Why did you let her get hurt?

20:52.440 --> 20:53.760
Other ways?

20:55.240 --> 20:58.080
Like you, Mr. Zhao? Betraying us
and swallowing your pride for survival?

21:00.640 --> 21:03.160
That is something I cannot do.
She does not want it either.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.720
I have known her since we were children.

21:07.560 --> 21:11.400
I have watched her prepare for the worst,
endure silently, and bide her time.

21:11.480 --> 21:13.040
She will understand my choice.

21:16.000 --> 21:20.040
Under another's roof,
some things must indeed be endured.

21:20.920 --> 21:23.680
But some things cannot be endured.

21:23.760 --> 21:26.240
If she endures it, that would mean
she is no longer Ji Yingying.

21:27.880 --> 21:31.640
Mr. Zhao, if you still remember
the bond you once shared,

21:32.640 --> 21:34.280
even though you cannot be her man,

21:35.560 --> 21:37.960
then, at the very least, be a good man.

21:41.880 --> 21:46.120
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

21:47.600 --> 21:50.560
If I lose, I can simply start over.

21:51.640 --> 21:52.720
But you?

21:53.280 --> 21:56.320
You hold no pieces.
You cannot even make it to the chessboard.

22:03.520 --> 22:05.320
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

22:05.400 --> 22:07.200
Xiuyuan has indeed been foolish.

22:07.280 --> 22:08.800
If he had not used fake Shu Red,

22:08.880 --> 22:10.720
our family could have won
the competition with dignity.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.800
During Brocade Weaving Competition,

22:18.880 --> 22:20.520
the fake Shu Red incident
was just a misunderstanding.

22:21.520 --> 22:24.920
Why? Do you have another perspective
on the matter?

22:25.520 --> 22:29.520
Shall we pay General Niu a visit together
and discuss it?

22:29.600 --> 22:30.560
Very well.

22:31.120 --> 22:34.040
Even if we put this matter aside,
there is the incident in the mountains.

22:34.120 --> 22:36.280
Others may not dare to blame
the Niu family,

22:36.360 --> 22:38.560
but some are already saying
that our family was behind it!

22:38.640 --> 22:42.040
That Ms. Niu is paired with Xiuyuan,
who is always confused.

22:42.120 --> 22:42.960
This…

22:43.480 --> 22:45.080
It is hard to say how much trouble

22:45.160 --> 22:46.560
this pair will bring
to our family in the future.

22:46.640 --> 22:48.840
Back then, you were determined

22:48.920 --> 22:51.680
to forge ties
with General Niu's family, sir.

22:51.760 --> 22:54.040
Now that the connection is made,

22:54.120 --> 22:58.640
who would have thought that Ms. Niu
would prove an ill-suited match?

22:59.760 --> 23:02.280
I imagine you are not feeling too pleased
about it now, sir.

23:03.240 --> 23:05.600
Are you implying that
I have failed to manage this household?

23:06.680 --> 23:07.520
I would not dare.

23:07.600 --> 23:09.080
- We would not dare.
- We would not dare.

23:10.800 --> 23:11.640
Where is Xiuyuan?

23:11.720 --> 23:14.120
He went to the General's residence
yesterday for a visit.

23:14.200 --> 23:15.400
That is right.

23:16.040 --> 23:19.840
After all,
Ms. Niu is still General Niu's daughter.

23:19.920 --> 23:21.920
We must not neglect proper etiquette.

23:23.280 --> 23:26.640
Our family has secured
the title of Brocade Master.

23:27.160 --> 23:30.680
The next step is to unite
with other brocade merchants

23:30.760 --> 23:32.680
and collaborate
to complete the tribute brocade.

23:32.760 --> 23:33.800
From now on,

23:35.200 --> 23:36.680
you do not need
to trouble yourself over it, Grandfather.

23:36.760 --> 23:39.280
Xiuyuan, you have returned.
What did General Niu said?

23:41.760 --> 23:44.520
He said that,
given Grandfather's advanced age,

23:44.600 --> 23:45.960
the affairs
of the Brocade Master's household

23:46.040 --> 23:47.560
should be handed over to me.

23:47.640 --> 23:49.000
What?

23:55.800 --> 24:00.200
Are you using the Niu family's influence
to pressure me?

24:04.280 --> 24:09.840
General Niu's suggestion was likely made
out of consideration of your age, sir.

24:09.920 --> 24:11.880
Perhaps it is time
for you to enjoy some peace.

24:12.680 --> 24:17.920
Xiuyuan may be young,
but he is capable and resourceful,

24:18.000 --> 24:19.400
and now he has General Niu's favor.

24:20.280 --> 24:22.000
If he were to become the patriarch,

24:22.080 --> 24:25.760
our ties with the Niu family
would grow even stronger.

24:25.840 --> 24:29.040
As for the rumors outside,
who would dare to spread them further?

24:33.280 --> 24:35.080
- Grandfather, please step down.
- You!

24:39.000 --> 24:40.760
How dare he says such a thing?

24:45.280 --> 24:47.240
Back then, my grandfather

24:48.320 --> 24:50.080
managed this household for 50 years,

24:50.160 --> 24:54.320
and my father learned at his side
for 30 years before managing it.

24:54.960 --> 24:58.800
I, too, have spent 30 years
learning under my father.

24:59.720 --> 25:01.880
Xiuyuan, you are indeed gifted.

25:01.960 --> 25:05.800
But spend another ten years
under my guidance,

25:05.880 --> 25:07.920
and then I will let you manage the family.

25:10.000 --> 25:12.280
Grandfather, will you not step down?

25:13.520 --> 25:18.560
The Zhao family will be yours one day.
Why rush it?

25:22.920 --> 25:24.960
Then, do not blame me
for being disrespectful.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.720
Zhao Ping!

25:29.920 --> 25:30.920
You!

25:31.000 --> 25:34.040
Zhao Xiuyuan,
are you rebelling against the patriarch?

25:35.960 --> 25:38.360
Xiuyuan, what are you doing?

25:38.440 --> 25:41.320
My father-in-law said he was concerned
my succession might face resistance.

25:41.400 --> 25:43.240
So, he lent me some men to help me.

25:43.320 --> 25:44.520
You!

25:48.360 --> 25:52.520
Xiuyuan, we are family.
Why escalate things like this?

25:53.120 --> 25:55.920
He is just momentarily confused.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.720
When General Niu was angry
in the mountains,

25:58.320 --> 26:00.760
he dared to threaten
even imperial officers.

26:01.280 --> 26:03.960
Who among us would dare disobey his words?

26:04.720 --> 26:07.600
Everyone, do you agree?

26:16.040 --> 26:18.520
Father, stepping down is a minor matter.

26:18.600 --> 26:22.400
But provoking General Niu
is a serious issue.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.560
You

26:26.280 --> 26:27.360
should step down.

26:37.200 --> 26:40.480
Grandfather, I think there is no harm

26:41.760 --> 26:43.080
in Xiuyuan becoming the patriarch.

26:59.720 --> 27:01.040
Zhao Xiuyuan,

27:01.720 --> 27:03.240
the second grandson

27:05.120 --> 27:06.880
of the Zhao family.

27:09.600 --> 27:11.960
- I am here.
- You have brought great honor

27:12.040 --> 27:14.240
to the Zhao family
by becoming Brocade Master.

27:14.320 --> 27:18.120
Today, I pass the position of head
of the Zhao family to you.

27:19.040 --> 27:22.160
The responsibility of reviving
the Zhao family's legacy

27:23.320 --> 27:25.240
now rests on your shoulders.

27:26.160 --> 27:27.120
I accept it.

27:54.800 --> 27:55.640
Brother, wait!

28:09.800 --> 28:14.480
Could you visit Brocade Bureau
to verify the imperial orders?

28:17.360 --> 28:20.280
Yes, sir!

28:45.560 --> 28:49.360
My dear, when you took me home yesterday,
you did not meet with Father.

28:50.280 --> 28:52.560
Why is it that before he left today,

28:52.640 --> 28:56.400
his attitude suddenly shifted
and gave you his men?

28:58.520 --> 29:01.680
I do not recognize these men.

29:02.280 --> 29:05.000
They do not seem to be my family's guards.

29:06.400 --> 29:07.240
I hired people to impersonate them.

29:10.200 --> 29:11.680
How honest of you, my dear.

29:12.800 --> 29:14.200
You will not expose me.

29:15.080 --> 29:16.440
How far I can go determines

29:16.960 --> 29:19.440
how far you can go
as Brocade Master's wife.

29:21.720 --> 29:24.480
Do you remember your promise before?

29:25.000 --> 29:28.160
You said you would grant me some freedom
after we get married.

29:28.240 --> 29:29.800
What are you planning?

29:29.880 --> 29:32.160
Naturally, I will help you

29:32.240 --> 29:35.360
take control of the entire
Shu brocade industry.

29:35.440 --> 29:36.760
I have been weaving brocade for years.

29:37.280 --> 29:39.720
I understand the brocade industry
in Yizhou better than you.

29:40.560 --> 29:42.640
But I understand human nature even better.

29:43.240 --> 29:45.000
I also understand my father
better than you.

29:45.080 --> 29:48.600
He does not mind you borrowing his name,

29:49.800 --> 29:54.880
but you must show him your worth.

30:09.560 --> 30:14.000
BROCADE BUREAU

30:14.600 --> 30:15.600
He is here!

30:18.600 --> 30:22.560
Since the death of Ji Guinan,
the stunning Shu red also vanished.

30:23.400 --> 30:24.920
It has not reappeared for years.

30:26.680 --> 30:29.800
Under the order of the imperial court,

30:29.880 --> 30:31.560
I was sent to Yizhou to investigate.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.720
And today, I can finally deliver results.

30:35.440 --> 30:38.120
Shu Red outshines all reds.

30:39.520 --> 30:42.680
When it appeared
at Brocade Weaving competition,

30:42.760 --> 30:44.200
its brilliance stunned the audience.

30:44.880 --> 30:47.520
Today, I officially declare

30:47.600 --> 30:48.800
Shu Red Silk

30:49.480 --> 30:50.720
returns to the Wall of Colors!

30:50.800 --> 30:52.760
Good!

30:52.840 --> 30:53.800
Well done!

31:00.320 --> 31:01.560
Bravo!

31:08.480 --> 31:10.400
Good! Well done!

31:13.320 --> 31:17.240
SHU RED, JI YINGYING

31:27.040 --> 31:29.920
BROCADE BUREAU

31:36.800 --> 31:39.840
SHU RED, JI YINGYING

31:41.800 --> 31:44.000
You were the one who rediscovered Shu Red.

31:45.080 --> 31:46.640
Naturally, it should bear your name.

32:13.880 --> 32:15.160
Hang it up!

32:15.240 --> 32:17.560
Good!

32:18.160 --> 32:19.360
Well done!

32:23.880 --> 32:25.720
- Good!
- Well done!

32:44.840 --> 32:46.760
One day, I will create new colors.

32:46.840 --> 32:48.240
I will become Brocade Master.

32:48.320 --> 32:51.480
Then, my name
can be placed right next to my father's.

32:51.560 --> 32:54.320
Very well. I will keep a spot
open for you right here.

32:57.640 --> 32:58.800
This is incredible.

32:58.880 --> 33:00.920
I can dye Shu Red Silk now, Father!

33:05.040 --> 33:07.440
This is incredible!
I can dye Shu Red Silk now.

33:17.800 --> 33:18.760
Father,

33:19.880 --> 33:21.080
I have done it.

33:27.320 --> 33:28.280
Ms. Ji,

33:28.360 --> 33:30.360
Mr. Yang requests your presence to confirm

33:30.440 --> 33:32.760
the quantity of Shu Red Silk required
for the tribute brocade.

33:33.280 --> 33:34.120
This way.

33:55.560 --> 33:58.160
Congratulations, Ms. Ji,
for making Shu Red Silk reappear.

33:58.680 --> 33:59.520
After hardship comes happiness.

33:59.600 --> 34:00.480
You are like a phoenix
rising from the ashes.

34:01.080 --> 34:03.600
But this is a rabbit.
What does this have to do with a phoenix?

34:03.680 --> 34:05.840
The phoenix is too difficult to draw.
I have not mastered it yet.

34:05.920 --> 34:07.720
So, Ms. Ji,
you will have to settle for this.

34:07.800 --> 34:09.159
Did you make this yourself?

34:12.800 --> 34:14.840
How is your injury?

34:15.719 --> 34:18.199
If I were not fine,
would my mother have let me out?

34:19.080 --> 34:22.360
But surely, you did not call me in here
just to ask about this.

34:25.159 --> 34:26.320
What if I did?

34:37.360 --> 34:38.199
Have a seat.

34:42.000 --> 34:44.800
I am returning this to its rightful owner.
My master found it.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.800
Where did he find it?

34:46.880 --> 34:48.600
I do not know exactly where.
I am still investigating it.

35:10.120 --> 35:12.600
My father lost his life
because of fake brocade.

35:13.120 --> 35:15.040
The Niu family built their illegal
brocade workshop in the mountains

35:15.120 --> 35:16.520
to make fake brocade.

35:17.040 --> 35:20.120
Perhaps that was how they swapped
genuine brocade for fake ones back then.

35:20.200 --> 35:23.360
When the truth came to light,
my father became the scapegoat.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.560
Is that right?

35:25.520 --> 35:26.600
Ms. Ji,

35:27.760 --> 35:29.240
how about we make a pact?

35:29.320 --> 35:31.200
The investigation is mine to handle.
I will uncover the truth.

35:31.280 --> 35:32.520
What must I do?

35:33.760 --> 35:34.880
Focus on business.

35:36.720 --> 35:39.480
I may seem well-off,
but in truth, I am not far from poverty.

35:40.080 --> 35:43.320
One day,
I might need your support, Ms. Ji.

35:46.640 --> 35:47.920
According to the law,

35:48.000 --> 35:49.360
bribery is punishable by imprisonment,

35:49.440 --> 35:50.600
and accepting bribes
is punishable by death.

35:50.680 --> 35:51.680
I would not dare.

35:51.760 --> 35:54.840
When the time comes,
you can toss a money pouch on the ground.

35:54.920 --> 35:56.360
I will pretend to pick it up.

35:56.440 --> 35:58.200
At most, it is just keeping
what I found and not turning it in.

35:58.280 --> 36:00.760
I would be accused of moral failing,
not breaking the law.

36:01.640 --> 36:02.800
You are a corrupt officer!

36:08.440 --> 36:12.160
Mr. Yang, I hope
you can clear my father's name soon.

36:14.240 --> 36:15.040
When that day comes,

36:15.120 --> 36:16.440
I will fund the construction of a shrine
in your honor.

36:18.080 --> 36:19.880
Mr. Yang?

36:29.120 --> 36:30.040
Come inside.

36:34.840 --> 36:38.120
Mr. Yang,
Mr. Yang Juxian has requested an audience.

36:38.720 --> 36:39.600
No.

36:39.680 --> 36:42.200
But he said if you do not want to see--

36:42.280 --> 36:43.920
- Leave!
- Yes, sir.

36:54.720 --> 36:58.480
Honestly, I do not have
any deep grudge against him.

36:59.520 --> 37:02.120
The past was not entirely his fault.

37:02.720 --> 37:04.320
I was just too young to understand.

37:05.000 --> 37:06.320
But the past is the past.

37:07.000 --> 37:09.440
There is no need to reconcile,
and even less need for apologies.

37:11.360 --> 37:14.640
I am not used to, nor do I need,
a father who suddenly decides to reappear.

37:21.760 --> 37:24.680
My mother was furious
with me this time too.

37:25.280 --> 37:27.560
It seemed like if I do not listen to her,
she would disown me.

37:29.880 --> 37:33.160
But I am myself first,
and only then am I her daughter.

37:33.960 --> 37:36.480
I can care for her, honor her,

37:36.560 --> 37:38.280
even trade my life for hers.

37:38.800 --> 37:41.520
But I cannot live
the way she says I should.

37:41.600 --> 37:44.320
If I did, I would lose myself.

37:44.920 --> 37:47.280
I would not know
why I was born into this world.

37:48.600 --> 37:50.720
My mother would live
with that guilt forever.

37:57.400 --> 37:59.280
So, what you are saying is

38:00.280 --> 38:02.040
I should not reconcile with him?

38:07.400 --> 38:08.560
Then, should I reconcile with him?

38:11.800 --> 38:13.280
What exactly do you want me to choose?

38:13.360 --> 38:15.720
You should choose
what your heart truly wants.

38:15.800 --> 38:17.960
Whatever you decide, I will support you.

38:23.720 --> 38:24.920
It is because we are allies.

38:25.000 --> 38:26.440
This is what I am here for.

38:36.560 --> 38:37.920
Here, have something sweet.

38:41.360 --> 38:44.880
Ms. Ji, your method of offering comfort
is rather lacking.

39:00.000 --> 39:03.360
THE BAI RESIDENCE

39:06.960 --> 39:09.680
I was wearing a veil,
and no one saw me come in.

39:09.760 --> 39:11.720
It will not hinder my covert activities.

39:11.800 --> 39:13.520
Sheng, do not be upset.

39:13.600 --> 39:16.920
I have already gathered information
on the major brocade merchants in Yizhou.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.640
Three families are worth your attention.

39:19.240 --> 39:20.440
The Yang, Zhao, and Yu families.

39:21.000 --> 39:22.720
The Yang family consistently claims
the title of Brocade Master,

39:22.800 --> 39:25.280
with strong connections and reputation
in Chang'an.

39:26.280 --> 39:30.720
But the second son of the Zhao family
has now become the son-in-law of Niu Jin

39:30.800 --> 39:32.840
and recently won first place
at Brocade Weaving Competition.

39:33.440 --> 39:36.160
The eldest son of the Yu family
tragically passed away young,

39:36.240 --> 39:37.640
leaving them without an heir.

39:37.720 --> 39:38.600
They have fallen into decline.

39:40.320 --> 39:42.960
The red phoenix you saw
when you entered the city

39:43.040 --> 39:45.360
belongs to Ji Yingying,
the president of Bloom Society.

39:45.440 --> 39:48.880
She is the daughter of Ji Guinan
and heir to Shu Red Silk legacy.

39:49.400 --> 39:52.840
But she can only dye silk
and does not know how to weave brocade.

39:53.360 --> 39:55.360
If you want to join the brocade industry,

39:55.440 --> 39:57.080
one of these three families
is your best bet.

39:59.960 --> 40:01.280
Join the brocade industry?

40:01.360 --> 40:02.920
How do you propose I do that?

40:03.000 --> 40:07.040
Should I open a brocade store
or build a trade caravan?

40:07.560 --> 40:10.760
If it were that simple,
why would I need to come in person?

40:13.840 --> 40:15.840
There is a saying
among the people of Zhongyuan.

40:15.920 --> 40:19.760
Teach a man to fish,
rather than give him a fish.

40:23.400 --> 40:27.160
Everyone, my master has long admired
the magnificence of Shu brocade.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.920
He has traveled far
in pursuit of its splendor.

40:29.000 --> 40:29.840
GILDED WEAVE ATELIER

40:29.920 --> 40:32.720
Shu brocade has a thousand patterns,
and each pattern carries its own value.

40:32.800 --> 40:35.440
We find ourselves at a loss
on how to price such treasures.

40:35.520 --> 40:38.440
Price it too low, and we fear
we will insult the craftsmanship.

40:38.520 --> 40:41.240
Price it too high, and it might cheapen
the rarity of true masterpieces.

40:41.760 --> 40:43.960
Thus, we have come to seek the wisdom

40:44.040 --> 40:46.240
of you esteemed experts
in the brocade industry.

40:46.320 --> 40:48.120
Help us estimate the value.

40:48.200 --> 40:51.840
We welcome brocade from anyone
willing to offer them.

40:52.440 --> 40:54.120
We will hang the brocade here,

40:54.200 --> 40:56.000
for all to evaluate.

40:56.680 --> 40:59.760
If you have exceptional item,
we are willing to pay handsomely for it.

40:59.840 --> 41:03.880
Each of you will write down
the value you believe this brocade holds.

41:03.960 --> 41:08.160
The final price
will be the average of your valuations.

41:08.240 --> 41:10.560
Your method is certainly novel.

41:10.640 --> 41:12.680
But what is the benefit for us?

41:12.760 --> 41:14.600
- Yes!
- Exactly!

41:14.680 --> 41:16.240
Everyone, please watch this.

41:19.120 --> 41:20.320
The show has started!

41:21.480 --> 41:23.480
It is an excellent question.

41:23.560 --> 41:29.120
Business is about fairness,
a balance of giving and taking.

41:30.600 --> 41:32.960
Everyone, I am asking for your help,

41:33.040 --> 41:35.520
but I would never let your efforts
go unrewarded.

41:38.560 --> 41:39.640
What is that supposed to mean?

41:39.720 --> 41:43.880
Write your name
on one side of this bamboo.

41:43.960 --> 41:46.200
Write your price on the other side.

41:46.280 --> 41:48.320
Whoever's price is closest
to the final amount,

41:48.840 --> 41:52.200
I will reward them with a gold leaf.

41:52.280 --> 41:54.120
A gold leaf?

41:55.480 --> 41:57.200
How do we know it is not fake?

41:59.600 --> 42:00.520
Why did he receive one?

42:01.320 --> 42:02.480
We have not even started.

42:03.080 --> 42:05.240
You are the first to talk to my servant.

42:05.320 --> 42:06.480
We have traveled a long way to be here.

42:06.560 --> 42:08.840
You welcomed us
with sincerity and respect.

42:08.920 --> 42:10.960
This gold leaf is rightfully yours.

42:11.040 --> 42:12.400
Is it true?

42:12.480 --> 42:14.200
- Is it real?
- Is it real?

42:16.000 --> 42:17.640
Is it truly gold? It is real!

42:21.120 --> 42:22.200
In less than three days,

42:22.280 --> 42:26.200
all of Yizhou will know
that a new foreign merchant has arrived.

42:26.720 --> 42:27.800
One who spends lavishly

42:27.880 --> 42:29.160
and cherishes brocade
with an unmatched passion.
